║                  CDE Diagnostic Suite - Boot Menu                         ║
║                       Windows PE 10 (x64 Edition)                         ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

[DEFAULT]   CDE Diagnostic Suite (Recommended)
            Boots Windows PE with ToolkitGUI diagnostic interface.
            Provides full system diagnostics, repair tools, and utilities.

[SHELL]     CDE Command Shell (Advanced Users)
            Boots to command prompt for manual system troubleshooting.
            Direct kernel and system access for advanced diagnostics.

[MEMTEST]   Memory Diagnostic Tool
            Comprehensive memory testing utility.
            Tests system RAM for hardware errors.

[HD]        Boot from Hard Drive
            Exits diagnostic environment and boots installed Windows.
            Use if you need to restore normal operation immediately.

[REBOOT]    Reboot System
            Immediately reboots the computer.
            Safe option for exiting without booting an OS.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

USAGE:
  • Type the bracketed label above (e.g., DEFAULT, SHELL, MEMTEST)
  • Or use arrow keys to highlight and press ENTER
  • Press TAB to edit boot command line (advanced)
  • Press ESC to cancel

Boot will proceed automatically in 25 seconds.

